  "loc.description": "Download files that were saved as artifacts of a completed build",
  "loc.instanceNameFormat": "Download Build Artifacts",
  "loc.releaseNotes": "What's new in Version 2.0:\n- The task runs on the Node task runner instead of the agent's .NET plugin host, so it works in job containers and does not need .NET.\n- Requires an agent that supports the Node 20 or Node 24 task runner.",
